2.10 flag barbs
2.10 say "Barbed! Nick the flesh at the entry with the lancet before you pull."
2.10 say "instruction"
4.02 -- after tearing the first: status=running vitals=86.4 score=78 combo=0 counts=0/1/1/0 live=[Embedded,Laceration]
4.02 cue pluck
4.07 rate BAD "Torn" +15 combo=0
4.07 hurt 8
4.07 popup "-8"
4.07 spawn Laceration source=blade length=86 bleed=1.6 @(780,450)
5.55 -- after tearing the second: status=running vitals=73.3 score=93 combo=0 counts=0/1/2/0 live=[Laceration,Laceration]
"
`;

